WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.460
[intro music]

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.160
[crash]

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.340
[All]: Good morning, Hank!

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:14.720
[John]: This is the Savannah River.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:16.540
I like the bridge.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.100
I'm a sucker for bridges.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.240
A year ago I was in this park with the Yeti.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.600
Now I'm alone, and I miss her, and I'm sad.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.180
Is that what divorce would be like?

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:30.100
Would divorce be like being in Savannah, Georgia all the time, for the rest of my life, with no Yeti?

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.060
I'm in the airport of Savannah, Georgia.

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.940
I have to record this all in one take, and I'll tell you why I have to record it all in one take.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:38.100
It's because I left my power charger for my computer at home,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.233
so I only have 23 minutes of power left

00:00:40.233 --> 00:00:43.458
and it's looking increasingly like I'm not going to get back to New York by midnight.

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:45.748
Hank, I'm in a good-news-bad-news situation.

00:00:46.014 --> 00:00:46.894
The bad news:

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.660
I arrived at the airport four hours early but I won't be able to leave

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.460
until my regular flight leaves, because there's no earlier flights.

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:53.580
The good news?

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.860
This game seems to be called "Nerd Fighters".

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.960
That's my favorite kind of fighters.

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:02.000
Hank, do I want to be from America, or Japan, or Sweden?

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.460
Answer: Sweden.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:06.660
I would like to be this Viking nerd killer.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:09.700
Now I shall kill nerds.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.620
I'm scared. I'm scared. I've gotta turn off- I've gotta turn off the camera.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:15.340
I gotta go. I gotta go, bye.

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:18.480
[shuffling camera noises]

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.500
I don't like to travel.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.920
Okay, we're going to walk through the airport and see if we can find anything funny.

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.146
The word "choate" is funny.

00:01:24.146 --> 00:01:27.834
Because this airport service is Hilton Head, South Carolina, there are a lot of golfers here.

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:30.434
They're not wearing golf shoes but you can tell that they're golfers.

00:01:30.434 --> 00:01:31.214
You wanna see?

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:31.720
Wait.

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:34.480
Golfer. Golfer. Golfer. Golfers.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:35.660
Baby!

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:37.040
Golfer. Golfer.

00:01:37.980 --> 00:01:39.600
This makes things easier.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.680
A word of parting: my chin is prepared.

